  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Changes since 1.0.2:\n- Added X509 certificate store RSA key provider support.\n- Added file-based RSA key ring providers for raw RSA keys and password-protected PFX key material.\n- Added file-based and Azure Blob-based key chain storage providers.\n- Added Azure Blob-backed RSA key ring providers for RSA and PFX key material, plus an Azurite blob sample.\n- Fixed EF Core many-service-providers warning by reworking `UseEncryptedProperties` interceptor/provider wiring.\n- Added multi-targeted package assets for .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10 with matching EF Core dependency groups.",
